{"parse":{"title":"Butter and Cats and the Law of Energy Supply","pageid":395723,"revid":1863231,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Butter and Cats and the Law of Energy Supply</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/9a/Constellation_Butter_and_Cats_and_the_Law_of_Energy_Supply.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024422\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation Butter and Cats and the Law of Energy Supply\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/9a/Constellation_Butter_and_Cats_and_the_Law_of_Energy_Supply.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024422\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/9a/Constellation_Butter_and_Cats_and_the_Law_of_Energy_Supply.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024422 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/9a/Constellation_Butter_and_Cats_and_the_Law_of_Energy_Supply.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024422 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation Butter and Cats and the Law of Energy Supply\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Butter_and_Cats_and_the_Law_of_Energy_Supply.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Butter and Cats and the Law of Energy Supply.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aino\" title=\"Aino\">Aino</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cake_and_the_Art_of_Mechanism_Repair\" title=\"Cake and the Art of Mechanism Repair\">Cake and the Art of Mechanism Repair</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perpetual_Turbine_of_Metal_and_Light\" title=\"Perpetual Turbine of Metal and Light\">Perpetual Turbine of Metal and Light</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When the Elemental Skill <a href=\"/wiki/Musecatcher\" title=\"Musecatcher\">Musecatcher</a> hits an opponent, it will restore 10 Elemental <a href=\"/wiki/Energy\" title=\"Energy\">Energy</a> for Aino. Energy can be restored to her in this manner once every 10s.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Generation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Energy Generation\">Energy Generation</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Butter and Cats and the Law of Energy Supply</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Aino\" title=\"Aino\">Aino</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_4_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 4 Constellation\">Level 4 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FButter_and_Cats_and_the_Law_of_Energy_Supply%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The name of this constellation is likely a reference to the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/buttered_cat_paradox\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:buttered cat paradox\">buttered cat paradox</a>, a common joke based on the combination of two adages: \"cats always land on their feet\" and \"buttered toast always lands buttered side down.\" The paradox arises when one considers what would happen if one attached a piece of buttered toast (butter side up) to the back of a cat, then dropped the cat from a large height.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FButter_and_Cats_and_the_Law_of_Energy_Supply%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Butter and Cats and the Law of Energy Supply</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">黄油与猫与供能法则</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Nǎiyóu yǔ Māo yǔ Gōngnéng Fǎzé</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Cream, Cats, and the Law of Energy Supply</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">奶油與貓與供能法則</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Nǎiyóu yǔ Māo yǔ Gōngnéng Fǎzé</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">バターと猫とエネルギー供給の法則</span><br /><small><i>Bataa to Neko to Enerugii K